{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15218070","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1521807001:0":{"text":"Mirehold is Wildborn territory! Every blade of grass, every tree belongs to us! Don't even think about stealing anything!","source_cn":"水泽营地是雅库伯尔的领地，里面一草一木都属于雅库伯尔！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD064372F85F4FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521807002:0":{"text":"There are <style=\"highlight\">things we left behind</style>!","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>我们留下的东西<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA649B69005BA33EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521807003:1":{"text":"Silence!","source_cn":"都闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDEA30A832FA5FF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521807004:0":{"text":"You, Lord of Halia. What's going on?","source_cn":"你，呼临的领主。怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FA75F858897EE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521807005:0":{"text":"My soldiers... well, when they were stationed at Mirehold, they left a few things behind. They just want to get them back, that's all.","source_cn":"我的士兵们之前……唔，待在水泽营地的时候，遗留了一些东...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162AA23321960C35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521807006:0":{"text":"Lies! You're just here to steal from us!","source_cn":"胡扯！你们分明是想偷东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B61794267E542A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521807007:0":{"text":"No way! We would never do that! Most of what they left is just armor.","source_cn":"才不是！遗留下来的东西大多是盔甲，雅库伯尔从来都没用过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48FAC15351BD5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521807008:0":{"text":"Look, you can keep all the unimportant stuff, but <style=\"highlight\">Perseus' shield</style> has to come back with us.","source_cn":"一些无关紧要的东西，不还也没关系……但是其中还有<st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7EB025E16C27A33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521807009:0":{"text":"Chief Kordan, you're the leader of the Wildborn. Please ask them to return our belongings.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔的首领，请你让他们把这些东西还给呼临。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF5742494EE96C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1521807010:0":{"text":"Perseus... He was a thorn in our side...","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，哼。他让雅库伯尔吃过很多苦头。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A2B3F24158B958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521807011:0":{"text":"But he was a good fighter and a strong leader.","source_cn":"但他很强，是个不错的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D2881AB990815E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521807012:0":{"text":"Zoka, where are the things they're looking for?","source_cn":"泽卡，东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59C745CC84DC1637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521807013:0":{"text":"The Halians lost! The Wildborn should claim all that remains.","source_cn":"战败的是呼临，那些东西就应该随雅库伯尔处置！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x839ED491840FAF0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521807014:0":{"text":"Don't make me ask you again...","source_cn":"我再问一遍。东西在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC62D69B7A9A2F565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1521807015:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1521807016:0":{"text":"I... I threw all the Halians' stuff <style=\"highlight\">outside the camp</style>. Dumped it up <style=\"highlight\">north</style>.","source_cn":"我……我把呼临人的东西都<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB886A17761B68F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1521807017:0":{"text":"How could you just toss Perseus' shield away like it's nothing?","source_cn":"你——你怎么能随意丢弃珀尔修斯的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80DF771BC0FA6EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1521807018:0":{"text":"Forget it... I'm going to find it right now.","source_cn":"算了……我现在就去把它拿回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB46F5B6DAAD12E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1521807019:0":{"text":"Sign the truce first, then you can go.","source_cn":"签完停战合约，你才可以去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B275162EAABFD52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1521807020:0":{"text":"No... not until I have Perseus' shield in my hands.","source_cn":"……不，不行。我必须先拿到珀尔修斯的遗物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57589938BBCCC270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1521807021:0":{"text":"Perseus... he was everything to Halia. I won't rest until I can lay his shield to rest with him. He deserves that much.","source_cn":"珀尔修斯是呼临的英雄，我必须要让他的每样东西，都陪伴他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCDA284D59E3E63F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1521807022:0":{"text":"With no truce signed, do you wish to reignite the fires of war, Lord of Halia?","source_cn":"不停战，你的意思是让战争重新开始？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04499ADB7F442178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1521807023:0":{"text":"The choice is up to you.","source_cn":"你自己选。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEE0FCAC6470A5D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1521807024:0":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFAC0431F3A27EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:34:1521807024":{"text":"I...","source_cn":"我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFAC0431F3A27EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1521807025:1":{"text":"... Alright.","source_cn":"可以。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17BB36EC9C26DCC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1521807028:1":{"text":"As long as we can retrieve Perseus' shield, I have no objections.","source_cn":"只要能取回珀尔修斯的遗物，我没意见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB8561CE8548C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1521807029:0":{"text":"Let's <style=\"highlight\">head north</style>. Now.","source_cn":"那现在就去。<style=highlight>营地的北...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30217A8D8F718F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:0:1":{"text":"It's a quick trip. We could go together.","source_cn":"只是取个东西，不如一起去？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x28ED9AD7E7847D42","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It's a quick trip. We could go together.","female":"It's a quick trip. We could go together.","variant_male_record_index":"78805","variant_female_record_index":"78806","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1521807026:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1521807027:1":{"text":"He can go, but only if we go with him. He needs to be watched.","source_cn":"行。他可以去取，但是我和你也一起。他需要接受监督。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F30C500BC8D86AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:34:1:2":{"text":"Stay calm and think of your warriors.","source_cn":"想想雅库伯尔的战士，体谅阿邦德吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91996AD007526BF1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Stay calm and think of your warriors.","female":"Stay calm and think of your warriors.","variant_male_record_index":"78807","variant_female_record_index":"78808","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士泽卡":{"text":"Warrior Zoka","source":"战士泽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:长官皮洛斯":{"text":"Captain Pilos","source":"长官皮洛斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:戈丹":{"text":"Kordan","source":"戈丹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:领主阿邦德":{"text":"Abundius","source":"领主阿邦德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":32,"speaker_count":4}}